        "position": 1,
        "title": "Soft and secure",
        "text": "This is. Very nice slip lead. The adjusting mechanism is great and seems more secure than the sliding leather loop on many other leads. The rope is nice and soft so it’s comfortable for both the dog and the walker. I had one that our dog chewed through when left on in the house, and ordered two to replace it. Not the cheapest but well worth the money compared to stiffer, less secure leads I’ve tried.",
