      {
        "position": 2,
        "title": "Great Leash!",
        "text": "Best leash I have ever purchased! My pit is again in training after a previous trainer used a different type of leash on her, our new trainer transitioned her to the 3/8inch, 8 ft MAD DOG leash in a figure 8. She walks like a dream without pulling, which I am so happy about. The leash is easy to use and the material is soft yet sturdy and I really like the spring stopper. I will be purchasing more colors! You will not regret your purchase of this product.",
        "rating": 5,
